SUMMARY:The Addams Family Musical
DESCRIPTION:A comical feast that embraces the wackiness in every family\, features an original story and a dilemma that’s every father’s nightmare: Wednesday Addams\, the ultimate princess of darkness\, has grown up and fallen in love with a sweet\, smart young man from a respectable family whom her parents have never met. She confides in her father and begs him not to tell her mother. Now\, Gomez Addams must do something he’s never done before– keep a secret from his beloved wife\, Morticia. Everything will change for the whole family on the fateful night they host a dinner for Wednesday’s “normal” boyfriend and his parents. \nRecommended for ages 10 and up
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/the-addams-family-musical-2/
LOCATION:Davis Musical Theatre Co. (DMTC)\, 607 Pena Dr.
CATEGORIES:Art,Community,Music,Stage & Dance
GEO:38.5504424;-121.716785
