DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260905
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
DTSTAMP:20260820T044746Z
CREATED:20260820T044746Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260820T044746Z
UID:10081060-1788566400-1790467199@thedirt.online
SUMMARY:Art Auction 2026
DESCRIPTION:Art Auction 2026\nViewing & Online Bidding: September 5-26\nReception: Friday\, September 11\, 6-9 PM (Free)\nThe Pence Gallery’s annual Art Auction offers the best in contemporary art\, all up for display at the Gallery\, and online for silent auction bidding. Preview fantastic sculptures\, paintings\, photography\, textiles\, and more by 100+ regional artists online at bit.ly/penceartauction and at the Pence starting on September 5th. Bidding opens online at midnight on September 5th and closes at 8 PM on September 26th during the Auction Party. Proceeds from this event provide essential support for our youth education programs and art exhibits\, serving more than 19\,000 people annually. \nArt Auction Party: Saturday\, September 26\, 6-8:30 PM\nTickets: $45 Pence Members/$50 Non-Members/$55 day of event\nJoin us for our Art Auction party and enjoy delicious food by Dos Coyotes Border Café and Nugget Markets\, fine wines by Turkovich Family Wines\, live samba and bossa nova music by Boca do Rio\, themed gift baskets to win\, and the bidding finale! Event tickets are available late August online at bit.ly/penceartauction or at the Pence. Bring your cell phone to bid! \nEvent Sponsors\nThe Davis CPA\, Nancy Roe\, The Dirt/Media Sponsor\, MAK Design + Build\, Pam Marrone & Michael Rogers\, Chris Corbett Design\, Fidelity Insurance Service\, Carbahal & Company\, First Northern Bank\, Yolo Federal Credit Union\, Blake’s Heating and Air\, Scott Motley/Merrill Lynch\, Yvonne Clinton\, DeMasi Group at Echelon Real Estate\, Fred and Mary Bliss\, Brooks Painting\, Andrew Dowling\, POMESCIKOVA Positive Design\, Hollie Malamud & Chris Kelsch\, Bullseye Leak Detection\, Yolo County Supervisor Sheila Allen\, Davis Chamber of Commerce\, The Artery\, Picasso Hair Salon \nThe Pence Gallery is open 11:30 AM – 5 PM\, Tuesday-Sunday (closed Mondays). \nQuestions? Email pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/art-auction-2026/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AA-2026-4x5-1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencegallery@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
