LAST-MODIFIED:20260903T002853Z
UID:10083080-1788595200-1788598800@thedirt.online
SUMMARY:Tai Chi Basics
DESCRIPTION:🌿 Tai Chi Basics Course 🌿\nSaturday\, September 5 | 8–9am\nStart your Saturday with movement\, mindfulness\, and a little vineyard tranquility! ☀️🍇\nJoin us every Saturday morning for our Tai Chi Basics Course\, a beginner-friendly introduction to this beautiful\, slow-moving martial art. Tai Chi combines mindful movement\, balance\, strength\, and fluidity to help you feel more grounded and connected. 🧘‍♀️✨\nThis introductory class focuses on foundational drills and postures designed to build balance\, leg strength\, coordination\, and body awareness while preparing you for a deeper Tai Chi practice. 🌱\nLeading the class is Daniel Pfister\, who has practiced Tai Chi for nearly 30 years! Daniel received intensive training while living in Taiwan for five years and later completed his master’s thesis studying the effects of Tai Chi stance training on blood pressure. 🇹🇼🥋\nWhether you’re completely new to Tai Chi or looking to strengthen your foundation\, come move\, breathe\, and start your weekend feeling refreshed! 🌞\n🎟️ Ticket Includes: Tai Chi Class\n📅 Every Saturday Morning\n⏰ 8–9am\n🍇 Great Bear Vineyards\nCome for the movement\, stay for the peaceful vineyard setting!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/tai-chi-basics-2/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
CATEGORIES:Fitness,Outside
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/9-5-26-Tai-Chi-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
GEO:38.5793487;-121.7524716
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A Davis CA 95616;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=24800 Co Rd 101A:geo:-121.7524716,38.5793487
END:VEVENT
