SUMMARY:Peace Picnic
DESCRIPTION:The Woodland Ecumenical and Multi-faith Ministries (WEMM)\, an interfaith council consisting of faith communities\, is hosting the annual Peace Picnic. The “Community Interfaith Peace Picnic” in Woodland\, is an event that involves bringing together people from various religious backgrounds to promote peace\, understanding\, and collaboration. The picnic features meaningful conversations\, games\, and several speakers. \n  \nThe event will occur on September 26th\, at 11:00 AM. Complimentary Pakistani food will be served. Drinks will also be included. \n  \nThe event is free for all. All ages are welcome. \n  \nFor more information\, visit: https://woodlandwemm.org/
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/peace-picnic/
LOCATION:Fern Park\, 750 West Southwood Drive\, Woodland\, 95695\, United States
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/avif:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/peace-picnic-3-J9prwNf86BatX8gk-e1786575310940.avif
END:VEVENT
