SUMMARY:Walnut Park Library Grand Opening
DESCRIPTION:The Walnut Park Library Grand Opening and Ribbon-Cutting Ceremony will take place on Saturday\, November 7\, 2026\, at 9:00 AM at 2660 Lillard Drive in South Davis. Sponsored by the Friends of the Davis Public Library\, this all-ages community event marks the official opening of Yolo County’s newest 12\,000+ square-foot facility. Attendees will enjoy a celebratory multicultural morning featuring family-friendly activities\, entertainment\, giveaways\, and guided exploration of the brand-new space.
