BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Davis Downtown": "https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-year-round-fresh-local-in-central-park-50th-anniversary-year-2-3-2/2026-11-11/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:davis_downtown
SUMMARY:Davis Farmers Market – Wednesday Evenings (50th Anniversary Year
 )
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T180000
UID:10002136-1794409200-1794420000@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:The Davis Farmers Market continues every Wednesday in Central 
 Park with new fall hours! \nBeginning Wednesday\, September 2\, the Wednes
 day market will be open from 3:00–6:00 PM\, replacing the extended 4:00
 –8:00 PM Picnic in the Park hours. \nStop by to shop for fresh\, locally
  grown produce\, artisan goods\, prepared foods and other market favorites
  from local farmers and vendors. It’s a great opportunity to stock up fo
 r the week\, meet up with friends\, support local growers and food makers\
 , and enjoy a beautiful afternoon in Central Park. \nThe Davis Farmers Mar
 ket is celebrating its 50th Anniversary in 2026\, marking five decades of 
 bringing fresh food\, local farmers and the Davis community together. \nWe
 dnesday Market Details: \n\nWednesdays from 3:00–6:00 PM\nCentral Park i
 n Downtown Davis\nFresh\, seasonal produce\nArtisan goods and prepared foo
 ds\nLocal farmers and food makers\nFamily-friendly and open to everyone\n\
 nFree to attend – shop local and enjoy your Wednesday afternoon at the D
 avis Farmers Market!
LOCATION:Central Park\, 301 C St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-year-round-fresh-
 local-in-central-park-50th-anniversary-year-2-3-2/2026-11-11/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Yolo County Board Game Gathering": "https://www.meetup.com/yolo-county-board-game-gathering/events/vwnqstyjcpbpb/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_yolo_county_board_game_gathering
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Yolo Board Game Gathering
UID:event_vwnqstyjcpbpb@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041630Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T210000
SUMMARY:Weekly Game Night at Blue Note
DESCRIPTION:Yolo County Board Game Gathering\nUpdate 8/14/25:\n**We're sti
 ll active**\, but we primarily use Discord to chat and plan events. (See g
 roup description for invite link.)\n\nWe still meet every Wednesday for bo
 ard games at Blue Note Brewing Company. We'll have a handful of tables res
 erved near the back\; just look for the pile of board games.\n\nPeople usu
 ally start arriving around 5pm\, and games start whenever people are ready
 . Blue Note closes at 9pm\, and although we have a 5-10 minute grace perio
 d there\, you should be in the process of final scoring by 9\, or else pac
 k it up and play again another day.\n\nGame night is open to all ages! Blu
 e Note is a brewery\, not a bar\, so there's no restriction against minors
 . In addition to their crafted-in-house beer selection\, water and sodas a
 re available.\n\nYou're not required to buy anything in order to join us\,
  but we do encourage you to support local businesses. Blue Note's chef tea
 m makes a mean pizza\, and there are other nearby downtown restaurants and
  businesses.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/yolo-county-board-game-gathering/even
 ts/vwnqstyjcpbpb/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20250814T213602Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250814T213602Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
